Emberpeak Dragonfire Center Wander
    Events
        Time - Every 3.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
    Actions
        Unit Group - Pick every unit in (Units in DragonFireSpam01 <gen>) and do (Actions)
            Loop - Actions
                If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
                    If - Conditions
                        (Unit-type of (Picked unit)) Equal to Red Dragon (High Height)
                        ((Picked unit) is in EmberpeakDragonsCenter.) Equal to True
                        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
                            Conditions
                                (Current order of (Picked unit)) Not equal to (Order(flamestrike))
                                (Current order of (Picked unit)) Not equal to (Order(cast))
                                (Current order of (Picked unit)) Not equal to (Order(move))
                    Then - Actions
                        Set VariableSet TempPointDragonWander = (Random point in DragonFireSpam02 <gen>)
                        Unit - Order (Picked unit) to Move To TempPointDragonWander
                        Set VariableSet DragonSoundUnit = (Picked unit)
                        Trigger - Run Dragon Sounds <gen> (checking conditions)
                        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_TempPointDragonWander)
                    Else - Actions
